<section id="A3" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix C </span>Large Language Model Usage</h2>

<div id="A3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Large language models were used only for linguistic refinement (e.g., polishing sentences and checking grammar).
The core ideas, theoretical results, experimental design, and analyses presented in this paper were entirely developed by the authors without assistance from large language models.</p>
</div>
